{"time": 1751096795, "type": "recv", "message_id": "846499429", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1826949326]夏弥同样从木桶中起身，墨色长发从滂沱暴雨中的凌乱恢复，变回如微风般轻柔的样子。她随手把自己风干，眼睛半闭着窝到你旁边"}
{"time": 1751096856, "type": "recv", "message_id": "716851848", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“今天好累……”"}
{"time": 1751096981, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1328715497", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1404715639]（其实应该是内向，雌小鬼只是保护色（bushi））"}
{"time": 1751096992, "type": "recv", "message_id": "459267471", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"夏弥辛苦了这么久嘛。\"说话轻飘飘，挪到她身边轻轻靠上去，嗅一嗅，\"喜欢...\""}
