{"time": 1751130216, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1728030889", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（看成掉头发了）"}
{"time": 1751130424, "type": "recv", "message_id": "17426743", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "岩垣彻——你的养父坐在桌对面，目光看向窗外，偶尔看你一眼，又转过头去。良久，等你吃完，他才又看着你"}
{"time": 1751130444, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1657951148", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“怎么样？有信心吗？”"}
{"time": 1751130511, "type": "recv", "message_id": "318295325", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1282262051]你无从得知，但你确信在今晚之前，没有这样的变化"}
{"time": 1751130527, "type": "recv", "message_id": "395256960", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "擦擦脸，看看镜子里的头发，转身问夏弥，\"夏弥...你看看我的头发，这是掉色了吗？\""}
{"time": 1751130561, "type": "recv", "message_id": "106226014", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“感觉很简单的样子，会赢的”"}
{"time": 1751130573, "type": "recv", "message_id": "321467187", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我是要去猎龙吗）"}
{"time": 1751130669, "type": "recv", "message_id": "762475741", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=395256960]你洗漱的功夫，夏弥竟也离开了被窝“嗯……？少白头？”"}
{"time": 1751130754, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1191018155", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“五...感觉..卧挺腻害的”边吃边说话，以至于发音不是那么准确"}
{"time": 1751130758, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1341889043", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "低头抱住她，泪眼婆娑\"这怎么半啦，我才十八诶...\""}
{"time": 1751130977, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2018209544", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=106226014]你知道试炼的规则——年龄合适的孩子们会在一年之中的某天，准备好装备和补给，朝着村外的溪流深处前进，向温和的自然与野蛮的怪物展现自己的生命力，并与之拼尽一切力量和狡诈，猎杀你能打倒的最强大的怪物，并将你的战利品带回村子\n“切不可轻敌，你每次都这么说”岩垣彻叹了口气“山中的怪物，比不得训练场里那些被拔了牙的东西，那些只能算家畜……我知道你已经听烦了我这些话，但是这次一定要往心里去”"}
{"time": 1751131087, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1363247720", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“知道了，父亲，不用担心我了，我会小心的”"}
{"time": 1751131091, "type": "recv", "message_id": "347484949", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1341889043]“开玩笑啦……我们钢龙到了年纪表皮似乎也会变红……说不定这是你在成长的表现？”她伸手搓了搓你的头发"}
{"time": 1751131122, "type": "recv", "message_id": "637522589", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"成长?不会褪色吧..我好喜欢我现在的头发的..\""}
{"time": 1751131233, "type": "recv", "message_id": "971677975", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我吃饱了”"}
{"time": 1751131249, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1020721000", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "#拿纸巾擦擦嘴"}
{"time": 1751131286, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2025960247", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1363247720]“嗯……我……算了，没什么”他似乎有话梗在了喉头，最后还是咽了回去“别勉强，遇到没有把握的，就算了，就算什么也没带回来，也没人怪你”"}
{"time": 1751131377, "type": "recv", "message_id": "132955569", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=637522589]“不知道，不知道啦。我连自己的身体都不完全了解”"}
{"time": 1751131392, "type": "recv", "message_id": "774563226", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我一定会带最厉害的怪物回来的，放心吧父亲，毕竟我要成为世界第一猎人”"}
{"time": 1751131401, "type": "recv", "message_id": "364680033", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（罗罗诺亚索隆说是）"}
{"time": 1751131420, "type": "recv", "message_id": "855474622", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=132955569]“不过说不定，和灵峰上的那个家伙有关系”"}
{"time": 1751131425, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1256749460", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "叹口气，\"那要不要把这缕头发剪掉啦...看着和我的栗色头发好不和谐...\""}
{"time": 1751131472, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1543274983", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1256749460]“剪掉有些可惜……而且不对称，染一下吧？”"}
{"time": 1751131531, "type": "recv", "message_id": "31749644", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好吧...\"摸摸她的头发，\"今天做什么发型?"}
{"time": 1751131606, "type": "recv", "message_id": "909122137", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那我出门了”"}
{"time": 1751131659, "type": "recv", "message_id": "234622061", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=774563226]“……”你的养父叹气扶额，似乎有些无语，不过还没反驳你“这次，村里还有两个和你同年的孩子，会和你一起进山。我知道你们关系不算好，但是也都是我看着长大的……要是有解决不了的情况，别逞强，在包里我给你放了信号弹”"}
{"time": 1751131704, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1829922216", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=31749644]“嗯……和你一样就好了”"}
{"time": 1751131793, "type": "recv", "message_id": "197340930", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=909122137]你知道，按正规流程，试炼者要先去村口集结，再在村子祈福后一同出发"}
{"time": 1751131799, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1964293402", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好的好的”听到其他人的时候就敷衍的应付"}
{"time": 1751131822, "type": "recv", "message_id": "854467809", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“等着我的好消息吧”"}
